# Checkpoint commits

Frequent recovery commits with message:

```
automatic checkpoint <datetime>
```

Commit on **whatever branch is already checked out**. Do not create a new
branch unless the developer asked. Do not merge, rebase, squash, or force-push
main unless directed.

This is the same policy as AGENTS.md (same-workspace checkpoints) and the
user rule. Redundant on purpose.
